---
import Layout from '../layouts/Layout.astro';
---

<Layout
  title="Disclaimer"
  description="Disclaimer for Bug Days - Important information about the limitations and warranties of our developer tools."
  keywords="disclaimer, no warranty, Bug Days disclaimer"
  breadcrumb={[{ name: 'Disclaimer' }]}
>
  <div class="max-w-3xl mx-auto">
    <div class="bg-white dark:bg-slate-800 rounded-lg shadow-sm border border-gray-200 dark:border-slate-700 p-6 md:p-8">
      <h1 class="text-2xl md:text-3xl font-bold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-2">Disclaimer</h1>
      <p class="text-sm text-gray-500 dark:text-slate-400 mb-8">Last updated: February 2026</p>

      <div class="prose prose-slate dark:prose-invert max-w-none space-y-6">

        <!-- Warning Box -->
        <div class="bg-amber-50 dark:bg-amber-900/20 border border-amber-200 dark:border-amber-800 rounded-lg p-4 mb-6">
          <div class="flex items-start gap-3">
            <svg class="w-6 h-6 text-amber-600 dark:text-amber-400 flex-shrink-0 mt-0.5" fill="none" stroke="currentColor" viewBox="0 0 24 24">
              <path stroke-linecap="round" stroke-linejoin="round" stroke-width="2" d="M12 9v2m0 4h.01m-6.938 4h13.856c1.54 0 2.502-1.667 1.732-3L13.732 4c-.77-1.333-2.694-1.333-3.464 0L3.34 16c-.77 1.333.192 3 1.732 3z" />
            </svg>
            <div>
              <h3 class="font-semibold text-amber-800 dark:text-amber-200 mb-1">Important Notice</h3>
              <p class="text-amber-700 dark:text-amber-300 text-sm">
                All tools on Bug Days are provided for informational and convenience purposes only. Please read this disclaimer carefully before using our services.
              </p>
            </div>
          </div>
        </div>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">No Warranty</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            <strong>ALL TOOLS AND SERVICES PROVIDED BY BUG DAYS ARE PROVIDED "AS IS" WITHOUT WARRANTY OF ANY KIND, EXPRESS OR IMPLIED.</strong>
          </p>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-3">
            We make no representations or warranties regarding:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>The accuracy, completeness, or reliability of any results</li>
            <li>The fitness of the tools for any particular purpose</li>
            <li>The availability or uninterrupted operation of the service</li>
            <li>The security or error-free nature of the tools</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Use at Your Own Risk</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            Your use of Bug Days tools is entirely at your own risk. You assume full responsibility for:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Verifying the accuracy of any output or results</li>
            <li>Backing up your data before using any tools</li>
            <li>Evaluating the suitability of tools for your specific needs</li>
            <li>Any decisions made based on tool output</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">No Responsibility for Data Loss</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            <strong>We are not responsible for any data loss that may occur while using our tools.</strong> While our tools run entirely in your browser and do not transmit data to our servers, we cannot guarantee that:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Your browser will not crash or freeze during processing</li>
            <li>Output will be correctly generated in all cases</li>
            <li>Data will be properly formatted or converted</li>
            <li>Copy/paste operations will work correctly in your environment</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-3">
            <strong>Always maintain backups of important data.</strong>
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">No Guarantee of Accuracy</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            While we strive to provide accurate and reliable tools, we cannot guarantee that:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>All conversions are 100% accurate</li>
            <li>Edge cases are handled correctly</li>
            <li>Tools conform to all relevant specifications or standards</li>
            <li>Results are suitable for production use without verification</li>
          </ul>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-3">
            For critical applications, always verify results independently.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Not Professional Advice</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            The tools and information provided on Bug Days do not constitute professional advice. They are not a substitute for:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Professional software development practices</li>
            <li>Security audits or assessments</li>
            <li>Legal, financial, or technical consulting</li>
            <li>Official documentation or specifications</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">External Links</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            Our website may contain links to external websites. We are not responsible for the content, accuracy, or practices of any external sites. Linking to external sites does not imply endorsement.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Limitation of Liability</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            To the fullest extent permitted by law, Bug Days and its operators shall not be liable for any direct, indirect, incidental, consequential, or special damages arising from:
          </p>
          <ul class="list-disc list-inside text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300 mt-2 space-y-1">
            <li>Your use of or inability to use our tools</li>
            <li>Any errors, inaccuracies, or omissions in tool output</li>
            <li>Any loss of data or corruption of data</li>
            <li>Any reliance placed on tool results</li>
            <li>Any decisions made based on information from our tools</li>
          </ul>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Changes to This Disclaimer</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            We may update this disclaimer at any time. Changes will be reflected by updating the "Last updated" date. Continued use of the service constitutes acceptance of any changes.
          </p>
        </section>

        <section>
          <h2 class="text-xl font-semibold text-gray-800 dark:text-slate-100 mb-3">Contact Us</h2>
          <p class="text-gray-600 dark:text-slate-300">
            If you have any questions about this disclaimer, please <a href="/contact" class="text-indigo-600 dark:text-indigo-400 hover:underline">contact us</a>.
          </p>
        </section>

      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</Layout>
